\par \noindent 10.【解析】求按 $\dfrac {1}{2}:\dfrac {1}{3}:\dfrac {1}{4}$ 分配 $780$ 元时甲分得的钱数。 \\ 先将连比化为整数比，再按总份数分配。 \begin {align*} \dfrac {1}{2}:\dfrac {1}{3}:\dfrac {1}{4} &= \left (\dfrac {1}{2}\times 12\right ):\left (\dfrac {1}{3}\times 12\right ):\left (\dfrac {1}{4}\times 12\right ) = 6:4:3 \\ \text {甲分得} &= 780\times \dfrac {6}{6+4+3} \\ &= 780\times \dfrac {6}{13} \\ &= 360\ (\text {元}) \end {align*} 故选 B。\par \vspace *{1ex}
